Hello, aspiring Alchemists!
We have reached a huge milestone during our fantasy journey - the first public showcase during the PGA 2022 event in Poznan. 
We have shown a playable alpha build in order to get some feedback from players.

For three days Alchemist was present on players' screens to get attention and show the game's potential. Most of the time three PCs were occupied and people were discovering the game plot and exploring brand-new features, graphics, and environment.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42982753/558e6806a3ed468b7cf1b43ac95418f9272b5bab.png

Here is the constructive feedback we have noted:
1. Game positive aspects:
- stylized graphics
- fantasy environment;
- potions creation;
- various ingredients and aspects;
- ability to set up your own, cozy house;
- dog interaction;
- "mini" open world;

2. Game negative aspects:
- can't pet the dog😭;
- more quests;
- short gameplay after finishing the tutorial;
- awkward fighting mechanic;
- UI bugs;
- QoL improvements;

All good things must come to an end,
thanks to all the wonderful people we met!
See you next year! ❤️ 

Our next showcase coming soon so stay tuned and jump on our discord server!

